&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tubi is seeking a Director, Creator Growth to own the strategy and execution of our scaled creator acquisition program: this role builds the systems that bring creators to Tubi at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll design acquisition processes, set the performance standards for the long-tail portfolio, and partner closely with our product team to remove friction from onboarding and content delivery. You&#39;ll also connect the scaled pipeline to the broader creator strategy, ensuring top-performing non-exclusive creators are identified and elevated for deeper partnership consideration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has built creator or partner programs at scale, blends strategic thinking with operational rigor, and leads with data. This is a high-impact role at the center of Tubi&#39;s creator growth strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is hybrid and based in Los Angeles or New York, with regular in-office days required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy and execution for scaled creator acquisition, building the processes, systems, and partner relationships needed to grow the non-exclusive library to thousands of creators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish KPIs and measurement standards for the scaled program, monitoring creator and content performance across the long-tail portfolio and using data to continuously refine acquisition criteria and partner tiers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the product team to define and prioritize product requirements that reduce friction in creator onboarding, contracting, and content delivery at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with creator managers to ensure the scaled pipeline feeds the direct acquisition funnel and that top-performing non-exclusive creators are elevated for deeper partnership consideration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct workstreams across cross-functional teams (Legal, Business Affairs, Content Operations, Marketing, Product), establishing shared tools, clear lanes, and operating processes that keep internal partners aligned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft compelling communications on program performance and strategy for senior leadership, and own high-stakes partner and stakeholder communication across the portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply deep creator-economy expertise to steer bets across creators, partner types, and acquisition channels, and represent Tubi as a voice for creators at industry events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Background:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in the creator economy, digital media, streaming, or content partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building and scaling creator, partner, or supply acquisition programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data literacy, with experience establishing KPIs and using performance metrics to drive acquisition and portfolio strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of partnering with Product teams to shape tools, workflows, or self-serve platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional leadership skills, with the ability to align stakeholders and remove blockers across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People management experience, with a passion for developing talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of creator and digital content ecosystems (YouTube, TikTok, Instagram, and emerging platforms) and creator monetization models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive mindset with the ability to anticipate needs and take initiative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for creators, content, and how audiences engage across platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative and adaptable with a “solutions-first” mindset that brings curiosity, accountability, and creative problem-solving to every challenge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embodies Tubi’s values of inclusion, integrity, and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
