&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Tubi, Producers help transform creative ideas into fully realized, multi-channel campaigns. As a Producer, you bring together strategic thinking, creative understanding, and operational excellence to guide projects from early concept through final delivery. You play a central role in shaping how creative ideas come to life, partnering closely with creatives and cross-functional teams while ensuring timelines, budgets, and deliverables stay on track.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This is a hybrid role based out of our Los Angeles office. You must be willing to travel to our Los Angeles&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;office 2-3 days/week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This is a temporary position.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Creative Directors, Art Directors, and other members of the Creative team to interpret briefs, define creative approaches, and ensure concepts are feasible, executable, and aligned with campaign strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide thoughtful input during concepting to identify opportunities, spot challenges, and support creative clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary campaign liaison across necessary XFN teams like Content, Marketing, Product, Legal, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive alignment across teams, ensuring clarity, communication, and smooth handoffs at every stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a clear understanding of stakeholder goals and proactively anticipate needs or roadblocks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain creative intent from concept through production by facilitating communication and ensuring teams have what they need to deliver great work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce a wide range of campaign deliverables across 3 to 5 concurrent titles - including key art, trailers and promos, motion graphics, social assets, digital/growth creatives, on-platform placements, print, social, and presentation materials - ensuring consistency, quality, and alignment with creative intent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate shoots (video + photo) as needed - coordinating logistics, resources, and communication across internal and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own detailed timelines and ensure teams meet deadlines without compromising creative quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track feedback through rounds, ensuring notes are consolidated, actionable, and reflected in final deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organized file structures, campaign documentation, and delivery pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage external vendors and ensure they stay aligned with scope, timelines, and expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project budgets across multiple projects: tracking spend, negotiating costs, and holding vendors accountable to agreed-upon deliverables and rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all assets meet technical specifications, platform requirements, and brand standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Background:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience producing or managing integrated creative campaigns in entertainment, advertising, streaming, or an in-house brand/creative studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of how creative ideas are produced - across video, motion graphics, post-production processes (including sound mixing, QC, and finishing), editorial, print, digital growth, social, and CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with creative teams to elevate ideas and solve creative challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage budgets, vendors, and resource allocations for complex, multi-deliverable campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, organization, and leadership skills with the ability to influence and align diverse stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort leading teams through ambiguity, shifting priorities, and fast-paced production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Airtable, Google Workspace, Frame.io, Figma, and Adobe Creative Suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using AI-powered tools to optimize workflows and accelerate production tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine passion for film, television, entertainment, and innovative storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
