&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tubi is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Creator Marketing&lt;/strong&gt; to lead marketing strategy and execution for our growing slate of exclusive Creator titles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will own the go-to-market approach for Creator exclusives, partnering across Content, Creator, Marketing, Growth, Social, PR and other teams to build campaigns that effectively bring a creator&#39;s fans to Tubi and introduce creators to new viewers among Tubi’s 110 million monthly active users.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will help us understand what actually works—developing learning agendas, evaluating performance, designing experiments and translating those insights into stronger marketing strategies across the portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is equal parts strategic marketer, analytical thinker and builder. They know how to turn a title into a compelling audience proposition, understand the unique role creators can play in driving discovery and fandom, and are energized by creating new playbooks rather than simply applying old ones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This is a hybrid role based out of our Los Angeles office. You must be willing to travel to our Los Angeles&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;office 2-3 days/week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead go-to-market strategy for Tubi’s exclusive Creator titles, developing audience-first marketing plans that define positioning, target audiences, channel strategy, creator fandom activation and launch approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build differentiated launch strategies based on title opportunity, identifying where bespoke campaigns can have the greatest impact and where repeatable approaches can drive greater efficiency across the slate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audience Portability: Partner with Creators to drive best in class audience conversion from creator native platforms to Tubi.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own marketing strategy from planning through post-launch, bringing together cross-functional partners around clear objectives, roles, timelines and measures of success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead performance analysis across campaigns and titles, connecting marketing activity to title-level outcomes and identifying the drivers behind over- and under-performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop learning agendas for Creator title marketing, identifying the highest-value questions we need to answer about audiences, creative channels, creator participation and campaign effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and champion experimentation, partnering with Analytics, Growth and channel teams to test new tactics and continually optimize the marketing toolkit for Creators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn insights into action, translating campaign results and experiments into recommendations, playbooks and planning principles that improve future launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a portfolio-level view of performance across priority verticals, looking beyond individual launches to identify patterns across titles, audiences, fandoms, creators, creative approaches and channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Background:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in entertainment, content, creator, or social marketing, with experience leading talent driven go-to-market strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of content marketing and audience development, with the ability to translate a creator’s vision into a clear consumer proposition and marketing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with creators, influencers or talent-led content and an understanding of how creator audiences and communities behave differently from traditional entertainment audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated strength in performance analysis and measurement, with the ability to move from campaign data to actionable marketing recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing experimentation frameworks and learning agendas that ask new questions and help us improve marketing effectiveness over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across creative, analytical and operational disciplines and bring multiple teams together around a shared strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, including the ability to turn complex performance findings into clear recommendations for senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-moving environment with a growing slate, evolving processes and significant opportunity to build new ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine curiosity about creators, fandoms, entertainment and how culture moves across platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
