&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tubi is building a world-class product platform, and we are looking for designers to join our Product Design team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer, you will lead the end-to-end product design (UX, UI, prototyping) for multiple features across your pod&#39;s product surface. In this role, you will deliver both tactical and strategic design solutions that meet business objectives and customer needs. By partnering closely with cross-functional teams - including Research, Product, and Engineering - you will drive the vision and strategy for your pod, ensuring the creation of innovative, best-in-class user experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is hybrid in San Francisco (with 2 days in the office per week).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Research, Product, and Engineering to identify, prioritize, and scope new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate user flows, prototypes, and other design artifacts that communicate your solution hypothesis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft elegant and scalable design solutions that are aligned with best practices and fully compliant with engineering and accessibility requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garner approval from cross-functional stakeholders, manage and incorporate feedback, and drive towards consensus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct and synthesize limited user research relevant to your pod&#39;s priorities; collaborate with the Research team to generate insights and validate design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Research and Data Science to measure the impact of your design decisions and inform iterative improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work autonomously to identify new opportunities and influence your pod&#39;s product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Background:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically ~5-8 years of experience in building digital products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio that demonstrates exceptional design and prototyping skills, attention to detail, and the ability to solve complex problems through elegant solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills (verbal and written), and experience working with distributed teams across multiple time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on products that reach millions of users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to champion collaborative product-making and partner closely with Engineering and Product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with experiment-driven product development: using data and research to understand the needs, behaviors, and motivations of users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to, maintaining, and scaling design systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with industry standard design tools such as Figma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills that will set you apart:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
