&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with designing for diverse user needs and accessibility considerations from the start&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think holistically and create scalable design solutions that support fast iteration and feature expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating business strategy into coherent, intuitive user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
