&lt;li&gt;Own the UI/UX across 19 different platforms, ensuring a seamless and high-performing experience for millions of users worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and drive innovation in building experiment-driven features that push the boundaries of user experience in streaming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently ship features and improvements across Web and OTT apps with minimal guidance, collaborating with cross-functional teams to deliver high-impact updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize performance and reliability of OTT applications especially on low end platforms, ensuring smooth playback and interactions across various network conditions and devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve and maintain the CI/CD pipeline to streamline deployments and ensure high-quality releases across all platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement improvements in shared UI components, platform-specific optimizations, and overall front-end infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and collaborate with fellow engineers, sharing technical expertise and contributing to a culture of continuous learning and improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
