&lt;p&gt;Tubi is looking for a motivated Media Planning Specialist&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;to join our growing Media Strategy pre-sales team. This person will be an integral part of the sales process helping the Media Strategy team in the end-to-end development of client RFP responses - delivering pricing, inventory forecasts, audience research, targeting recommendations, and creative media solutions that reflect Tubi’s position as the leader in ad-supported streaming. This is a growth opportunity, and the right candidate will enter Tubi to understand the needs of the company, grow in a support role, and ultimately develop the skills needed to be a media professional.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role. Candidates must be willing to work in our Chicago office 3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
